      <li>You pick the term (3, 6 or 12 months) every time; nothing auto-extends.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>That's a fundamentally different model from an auto-renewing App Store or Google Play subscription. For pricing and term comparisons, see <a href="/en/premium">Telegram Premium plans and pricing</a>.</p>
